  "passphraseWarningBody": "The passphrase never leaves this device: nobody knows it, not even the people who made the app, and there is no way to reset or recover it. If you forget it, the notes on this device stay encrypted forever and nobody will ever be able to open them. Write it down somewhere safe, such as a password manager. Another linked device, with its own passphrase, keeps a copy of your notes.",
